## Quick Usage Guide

### Manual Run (All Books in `in/`)
```bash
./auto_convert.sh
```

### Dry Run (Preview Pending Queue)
```bash
./auto_convert.sh --dry-run
```

### Process Single Specific PDF
```bash
./auto_convert.sh "in/MyBook.pdf"
```

### Setup Recurring Automation via CRON
Add to `crontab -e`:
```cron
*/30 * * * * /path/to/BookConverters/auto_pipeline.sh >> /path/to/BookConverters/logs/cron.log 2>&1
```
